msgid "Changing parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/models/compare-lithium-ion.ipynb:570
msgid ""
"Since we have made current an input, it is easy to change it and then "
"perform the calculations again:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/models/compare-lithium-ion.ipynb:-1
msgid "[14]:"
